+---
+id: task-002-implement-rfc-6902-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work completed
+
+Implemented and exported `applyPatch(document, patch)` with RFC 6902 `add`,
+`remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. The implementation
+validates JSON Patch documents and pointers, preserves the input through deep
+cloning, and reports malformed or failed operations as errors.
+
+Added deterministic tests for every operation, root and escaped-key paths,
+immutability, malformed patches, invalid targets, and failed tests. Updated the
+README with the new public API.
